  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic runoff swamps outside Subchain City, 'Acid' Bathory is a survivor. The rare Hatchling Toxic mutation granted him resistance to the worst pollutants, but also left him perpetually radiating a faint, unsettling green glow. He learned to scavenge and fight early, making a name for himself in the back alleys of Dia De Drinks.",
    "class": "Infiltrator",
